  "title": "Patricia&#39;s Peanut Butter Pie",
  "description": "Peanut butter chips are sprinkled over the bottom of the graham cracker crust. Then a sinfully delicious concoction of peanut butter, honey, milk, and egg is spooned into that. This dreamy pie is then finished with a generous sprinkling of chopped peanuts.",
